i></ul><p class=""><strong>Supervisors:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p class="">Associate Professor&nbsp;<strong>Ingrid Hobæk Haff,</strong>&nbsp;Universitetet i Oslo</p></li><li><p class="">Professor&nbsp;<strong>Nils Lid Hjort</strong>, Universitetet i Oslo</p></li></ul><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" class=""></p>





















  
  





























  
  
    
  

    

    

    
