nbsp;<strong>Thomas Nagler</strong>, Ludwig Maximilian University of Munich&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="">Professor&nbsp;<strong>Bart Baesens</strong>, KU Leuven&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="">Professor&nbsp;<strong>Geir Storvik</strong>, University of Oslo</p></li></ul><p class="">&nbsp;<strong>Supervisors:</strong></p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p class="">Associate Professor&nbsp;<strong>Ingrid Hobæk Haff</strong>, University of Oslo</p></li><li><p class="">Associate Professor&nbsp;<strong>Riccardo De Bin</strong>, University of Oslo</p></li></ul>





















  
  





























  
  
    
  

    

    

    
